    {
      "id": "doxu8ds",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n6ftxdn",
      "content": "In 2015, the Planning Commission was replaced by NITI Aayog (National Institution for Transforming India). It acts as a policy think tank for the Government of India."
    },
    {
      "id": "ttfo31h",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Functions of NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vrh15rw",
      "content": "• Promote cooperative federalism."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qvxbybg",
      "content": "• Provide policy advice to the government."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "gvl0r3y",
      "content": "• Promote sustainable development."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The First Five-Year Plan (1951-56) was based on the Harrod-Domar Model and focused on agricultural development.",
        "The Second Five-Year Plan (1956-61) was based on the Mahalanobis Model, prioritizing rapid industrialization and heavy industries.",
        "Unlike the Planning Commission, NITI Aayog does not possess the power to allocate financial funds to states.",
        "The Governing Council of NITI Aayog comprises Chief Ministers of all States and Lt. Governors of Union Territories."
      ],
      "id": "wui1dlx"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5cfgut7",
      "content": "• Encourage innovation and entrepreneurship."
    },
    {
      "id": "kxlqx87",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bvyb4pu",
      "content": "• Planning Commission was established in 1950."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5d04p5n",
      "content": "• The First Five-Year Plan started in 1951."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ovsaqx5",
      "content": "• NITI Aayog replaced Planning Commission in 2015."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "na5jskv",
      "content": "• Prime Minister is the Chairperson of NITI Aayog."
    }
